WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:10.490
Pick the units, set the rent and terms, watch the deal calculator, and send it for approval when the discount is high.

2
00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:15.720
Offers start from a lead. Open the lead you are negotiating with.

3
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.130
Choose New offer.

4
00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:30.380
Tick the units in the offer. Their size and list rate are filled in.

5
00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.810
Set the rent per square metre a month.

6
00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.940
Add a rent-free period if you agreed one.

7
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:49.930
The deal calculator updates as you type: the monthly rent, the effective rate and the discount against the list rate. It also tells you when the discount needs a manager's approval.

8
00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:53.000
Create the offer.

9
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:05.530
The offer is saved with its full rent schedule. If an agent goes below the allowed discount, it waits here for a manager to approve it or send it back.

10
00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.570
Once approved, print the branded proposal or send it by email or WhatsApp with a signing link.
